<http://data.silknow.org/object/4295f0de-5cd8-3e16-b3a5-08c840c284dd>
        a                       ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment            "Chasuble of painted silk, China, 1700-1749"@en , "Chasuble of painted silk. With a floral design on white silk, and with a border. Marked off in panels as it would be if the design were woven or embroidered and orphreys were present. At the foot of the side panels on the front and the back are large butterflies hovering over pomegranates. Lined with silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note        "Chasuble of painted silk, China, 1700-1749"@en , "Chasuble of painted silk. With a floral design on white silk, and with a border. Marked off in panels as it would be if the design were woven or embroidered and orphreys were present. At the foot of the side panels on the front and the back are large butterflies hovering over pomegranates. Lined with silk."@en ;
